      "beat_id": "B03",
      "act": "RETRIEVAL",
      "narration_text": "If it's a RAG agent, inspect the actual retrieved chunks. Don't just ask, did retrieval work? Ask, was the correct piece of evidence in the top-k results? If not, you have a retrieval problem, not a generation problem.",
